    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good summary, thanks. Could you go into a bit more detail about the lachrymatory factor (the syn-propanethial-S-oxide)? Specifically, why does the reaction feel so sudden and almost \"sneaky,\" like it hits you out of nowhere? I want to describe that sensation to the kids in a way that emphasizes how quickly it transitions from a normal task to a stinging sensation.",
